  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業資源規劃-配銷模組",
    "sub_ename": "ENTERPRISE RESOURCE PLANNING-SALES & DISTRIBUTION MODULE",
    "describe_ch": "ERP已經成為企業營運管理之基石，本課程講授以配銷實務應用及ERP系統操作為基礎，輔以ERP系統之發展、演進、效益、採購評估、導入模式及維護等議題，設程設計可使學生具備考ERP應用人才證照之能力。",
    "describe_eh": "ERP is the foundation of enterprises’ operation and management. This course is based on enterprise distribution practice and ERP system demonstration and assisted by ERP evolution and development, its benefits, assessment during procurement, implementation model, maintenance and etc. The curriculum also is designed to help students be prepared for sitting the examination of ERP Certified Expert.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
